Z||000004||FieroJoe||03-04-2001||07:28 PM||||*starts leaf-blower*<P>Damn, if you can resurrect that, it will be sweet.  Especially with only 18,000 miles!<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||trigger||03-04-2001||09:01 PM||||Good find.  I don't know if you did, but don't forget to make sure there aren't any leaves in the blower motor, ductwork, near heater components, or any other really warm areas.  All I'll say is you suck. j/k  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Have fun.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000006||Wolfhound||03-05-2001||05:42 AM||||Onfire, no recall work has been done.<BR>trigger, I spent a day and a half just clean this car.  A shop vac and air compressor will do wonders. I was more worried about leaves in the heat shields.<BR> On a humorous note: When I removed the shield for the cat, to replace the gas tank, 4 spark plugs fell out! You could almost see the cuss marks on them.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> Black88GT, Those are blackberry and saw brier, didn't have a briering diagram so I took them out.||||reg||1
